WEBVTT

NOTE Tempos retirados das legendas gravadas no video e ajustados ao corte final (0,45 s cortados no inicio, ritmo 1,0165x). Posicionadas acima da faixa de legendas em portugues.

1
00:00:00.344 --> 00:00:02.804 line:72% size:88%
You know your company's indicators.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.657 line:72% size:88%
But do you know what is happening
to your people

3
00:00:05.755 --> 00:00:08.116 line:72% size:88%
before the problems show up
in the numbers?

4
00:00:08.411 --> 00:00:12.346 line:72% size:88%
An area can hit its targets
and, at the same time,

5
00:00:12.346 --> 00:00:15.789 line:72% size:88%
have underused talent,
people afraid to speak up

6
00:00:15.789 --> 00:00:19.134 line:72% size:88%
and strained relationships
with their leaders.

7
00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:23.561 line:72% size:88%
It was to help organisations
understand this reality

8
00:00:23.561 --> 00:00:26.316 line:72% size:88%
that I created Sistema 4.0.

9
00:00:27.103 --> 00:00:32.022 line:72% size:88%
First, we look at the employee experience
and map the talent in each team.

10
00:00:32.612 --> 00:00:36.449 line:72% size:88%
Then we analyse the results
to identify priorities.

11
00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:38.908 line:72% size:88%
And we don't stop at the diagnosis.

12
00:00:38.908 --> 00:00:43.335 line:72% size:88%
We work on leadership development,
on communication

13
00:00:43.335 --> 00:00:47.270 line:72% size:88%
and on the conditions that support
trust and psychological safety.

14
00:00:47.762 --> 00:00:51.008 line:72% size:88%
Throughout the process,
we follow how things evolve.

15
00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.632 line:72% size:88%
Because what people experience
inside a company

16
00:00:55.632 --> 00:00:59.764 line:72% size:88%
shapes the culture, the relationships
and the reputation it builds outside.
